      <activity id="ee05511f-c0db-526b-9792-b7369cedfdae" activityNameId="1c5ddf65-dcd5-5a2b-b1b2-f19cdd382874" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Installation for drip irrigation</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Installation for drip irrigation
This dataset represents the drip irrigation in Switzerland with a 90% irrigation efficieny. The inventory includes the water pumping of ground water and surface water, as well as the infrastructure. The water supplied to the plants (1m3) and the water evaporated or infiltrated shall be included in the crop production datasets.
nan
Location: The inventory is modelled for Switzerland
Technology: nan
Time period: nan
Production volume: nan
Sampling: Literature values and estimations.
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_4440fac8-85c3-3fe6-9314-45c033abd2b9.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
